{"4228250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beach Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 4228250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer! Sea! Sand! For everyone, these words mean rest and entertainment! But not for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You opened your own business on this paradise beach and work from morning till evening in your grocery store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine where products are displayed, manage your inventory, and keep track of popular trends and adjust to the ever-changing demand of the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flirt, Travel</strong><br>Flirt with the hot girls who are relaxing here. Travel to the beautiful places of the island and search for treasures in your free time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divide and Manage</strong><br>If you don’t have time or get tired of working in your shop, hire workers to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and personalize your own store, organize shelves and optimize for efficiency and aesthetics. Every detail is yours to customize, making your store truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expands your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your profits to take your shop to the next level! Expand your store, License new game systems and hire more staff to become the best store on the beach.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer! Sea! Sand! For everyone, these words mean rest and entertainment! But not for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You opened your own business on this paradise beach and work from morning till evening in your grocery store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store Management</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determine where products are displayed, manage your inventory, and keep track of popular trends and adjust to the ever-changing demand of the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flirt, Travel</strong><br>Flirt with the hot girls who are relaxing here. Travel to the beautiful places of the island and search for treasures in your free time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divide and Manage</strong><br>If you don’t have time or get tired of working in your shop, hire workers to help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and personalize your own store, organize shelves and optimize for efficiency and aesthetics. Every detail is yours to customize, making your store truly one of a kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expands your Store</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your profits to take your shop to the next level! Expand your store, License new game systems and hire more staff to become the best store on the beach.</p>", "short_description": "Summer! Sea! Sand! For everyone, these words mean rest and entertainment! But not for you! You opened your own business on this paradise beach and work from morning till evening in your grocery store.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228250/613627dc3cf7703ebfd657d43daaf45c82bdaf75/header.jpg?t=1772282072", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4228250/833be16b220db48d854e69c48f7b1a79700a4cdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772282072", "capsule_imagev5": "https://sha